  <entry>
    <id>https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/159.0/releasenotes/</id>
    <title type="html">Thunderbird 159.0</title>
    <author>
      <name>Thunderbird</name>
      <uri>https://www.thunderbird.net</uri>
    </author>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/159.0/releasenotes/"/>
    <updated>2026-10-27T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <published>2026-10-27T00:00:00+00:00</published>

    <content type="html"><![CDATA[
      

  
  

  
    

    
      
        
        

        
          <h3>What’s New</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Linux tray icons indicate unread mail and show its count in the tooltip</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Graph calendars are auto-detected on new account creation</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        
          </ul>
        

        
          <h3>Fixed</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Non-ASCII IMAP tags could exceed server length limits and be rejected</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Zoom Text Only option did not work in the View menu</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Multiple messages were printed even after canceling the print dialog</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Save All and Detach All failed for attachments with invalid filename paths</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>First Wrap Long Lines toggle did nothing in View Source</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>POP3 NTLM authentication failed because the password was sent incorrectly</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Search Messages menu option was enabled but did not work for saved search folders</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Quick Find shortcut (/) only worked after Ctrl+F was used once</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Unicode email addresses could hide different Reply-To destinations</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Newsgroups with UTF-8 names could display duplicate or incorrect messages</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>View &gt; Folders did nothing in Calendar and Tasks tabs</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Global search results did not display recipients in the To field</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Forwarding malformed MIME messages could omit attachments</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Retry and Save Locally failed after a sent-folder copy error</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Closing an unmodified compose window prompted to save when using Body Text</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>MP4 attachments could be truncated when forwarding messages</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Inline images disappeared when editing local or POP messages as new</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>EWS/Graph accounts could fail when outgoing server settings were incomplete</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Account Hub Edit Configuration did nothing for Exchange and Graph accounts</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>First message filter condition could not be removed even when others existed</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CardDAV address book sync stopped when the server rejected an invalid sync token</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CardDAV passwords were not saved, causing repeated login prompts after restart</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Thunderbird could hang on startup when restoring IMAP message and PDF tabs</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Malformed message database files could cause excessive CPU usage</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>IMAP namespace root folders were inaccessible due to duplicated folder names</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Excessive Microsoft Graph requests caused throttling and delayed message display</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>SMTP addresses with line breaks could inject unintended commands</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>POP3 sessions remained active after canceling the password prompt</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Remote content could load in news articles with missing message headers</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>RSS feeds could inject arbitrary Message-ID and References headers</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Large ICS calendar files could exhaust memory and freeze Thunderbird</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CalDAV calendars could stop syncing after a network error until restart</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Account Hub failed to discover CalDAV calendars for OAuth2 accounts</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Yearly recurring events with multiple times per day only appeared at the first time</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Visual and UX improvements</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p><a href="https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/security/known-vulnerabilities/thunderbird/#thunderbird159">Security fixes</a></p>
          
        </li>
      
    
    </ul>
  
  

<p>As always, you’re encouraged to <a href="https://connect.mozilla.org/t5/ideas/idb-p/ideas/label-name/thunderbird">tell us what you think</a>, <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/questions/new/thunderbird">ask for help</a>, or <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/enter_bug.cgi?product=Thunderbird">file a bug in Bugzilla</a></p>
<style> li p { display: inline; } </style>
      ]]>
    </content>
  </entry>
  
