  <entry>
    <id>https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/158.0/releasenotes/</id>
    <title type="html">Thunderbird 158.0</title>
    <author>
      <name>Thunderbird</name>
      <uri>https://www.thunderbird.net</uri>
    </author>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/158.0/releasenotes/"/>
    <updated>2026-10-13T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <published>2026-10-13T00:00:00+00:00</published>

    <content type="html"><![CDATA[
      

  
  

  
    

    
      
        
        

        
          <h3>Changed</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Quick filter responsiveness has been improved</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>ExtensionSettings policy installs add-ons from update_url when install_url not set</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        
          </ul>
        

        
          <h3>Fixed</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Copy Link Location only copied detached attachment filenames instead of full paths</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Thunderbird could crash while performing a Body search</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Attach File dialog failed to open when the previously used folder was unavailable</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Troubleshooting falsely reported crash reports were not configured when available</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Right-clicking inline images zoomed them instead of opening the context menu</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Switching to Unified Folders could leave All Folders enabled and not change view</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Archived Inbox folders ignored localized names and appeared as "INBOX"</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>OpenPGP key management had unlocking, handle leak, and protection state issues</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>OpenPGP backup password text could not be copied and context menu was transparent</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Quick Filter failed to match accented names when searching without accents</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Holding Ctrl+Enter could unintentionally confirm the send prompt and send duplicates</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Plain-text inline forwards omitted signatures placed below the quote</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Remote content exceptions without a scheme only applied to HTTP, not HTTPS</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Remote content exceptions incorrectly allowed wildcard hostnames like *.example.com</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Saved CalDAV/CardDAV credentials could be forgotten after restarting Thunderbird</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CardDAV setup failed without prompting for a password</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CardDAV address book sync failed to fetch newly added contacts</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CardDAV updates could corrupt vCard REV timestamps</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CardDAV discovery could fail on valid multi-status responses with mixed status codes</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>SMTP Kerberos authentication failed on Linux with STARTTLS</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>POP accounts repeatedly showed connection errors when Thunderbird started offline</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Matrix SSO with Save Token disabled reopened the login flow indefinitely</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>RSS filtering could lose tags and stall processing of later feed items</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CalDAV password prompts did not identify the username or calendar</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Calendar event edits could fail with localization error in the event dialog</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Updated calendar credentials were not saved from the authentication prompt</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Visual and UX improvements</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p><a href="https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/security/known-vulnerabilities/thunderbird/#thunderbird158">Security fixes</a></p>
          
        </li>
      
    
    </ul>
  
  

<p>As always, you’re encouraged to <a href="https://connect.mozilla.org/t5/ideas/idb-p/ideas/label-name/thunderbird">tell us what you think</a>, <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/questions/new/thunderbird">ask for help</a>, or <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/enter_bug.cgi?product=Thunderbird">file a bug in Bugzilla</a></p>
